        <mxCell id="box2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F0941C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#221F1F;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="2 . AUDIT THE DESIGN&#xa;Study the page&#39;s layout only (top row, side bar chart, middle pie chart...) and rebuild it as an empty, reusable design template with hollow slots." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="380" x="470" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="box3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#221F1F;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#221F1F;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" value="3 . COMPOSE THE PAGE&#xa;Create the new page / tab. Import the design template you need, then import the visual components you need into its slots." vertex="1">
